{"id":"801547714dbaa298","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-zfc-measure4-regular-content.md","title":"ZFC Measure4 Regular Content","display":"df-zfc-measure4-regular-content — ZFC Measure4 Regular Content","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-measure4-regular-content","aliases":["58-df-zfc-measure4-regular-content"],"display":"df-zfc-measure4-regular-content — ZFC Measure4 Regular Content","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-topology.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-measure4-regular-content"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-measure4-regular-content</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-measure4-regular-content — ZFC Measure4 Regular Content"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e7514bc4cefba4f2\" href=\"?note=e7514bc4cefba4f2\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-topology.md\">../batch14/58-df-topology.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau,\\mathcal R,\\nu,A,B,K,U,\\mathcal U,\\mathcal V\\in V\">\\(X,\\tau,\\mathcal R,\\nu,A,B,K,U,\\mathcal U,\\mathcal V\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Top}\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Top}\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e7514bc4cefba4f2\" href=\"?note=e7514bc4cefba4f2\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-topology.md\">../batch14/58-df-topology.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure4RegularContent}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure4RegularContent}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure4\\text{-}regular\\text{-}content} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure4RegularContent}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal R,\\nu)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)\\land\\mathcal R\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land\\emptyset\\in\\mathcal R\\land\\forall A,B\\in\\mathcal R\\;(A\\cup B\\in\\mathcal R\\land A\\setminus B\\in\\mathcal R)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\nu,\\mathcal R,[0,\\infty])\\land\\nu(\\emptyset)=0\\land\\forall A,B\\in\\mathcal R\\;(A\\cap B=\\emptyset\\to\\nu(A\\cup B)=\\nu(A)+\\nu(B))\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal R\\;\\left(\\nu(A)=\\sup\\{\\nu(K)\\mid K\\in\\mathcal R\\land K\\subseteq A\\land\\forall\\mathcal U\\subseteq\\tau\\;(K\\subseteq\\bigcup\\mathcal U\\to\\exists\\mathcal V\\in[\\mathcal U]^{&lt;\\omega}\\;(K\\subseteq\\bigcup\\mathcal V))\\}\\right)\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal R\\;\\left(\\nu(A)=\\inf\\{\\nu(U)\\mid U\\in\\mathcal R\\cap\\tau\\land A\\subseteq U\\}\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure4\\text{-}regular\\text{-}content} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure4RegularContent}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal R,\\nu)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)\\land\\mathcal R\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land\\emptyset\\in\\mathcal R\\land\\forall A,B\\in\\mathcal R\\;(A\\cup B\\in\\mathcal R\\land A\\setminus B\\in\\mathcal R)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\nu,\\mathcal R,[0,\\infty])\\land\\nu(\\emptyset)=0\\land\\forall A,B\\in\\mathcal R\\;(A\\cap B=\\emptyset\\to\\nu(A\\cup B)=\\nu(A)+\\nu(B))\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal R\\;\\left(\\nu(A)=\\sup\\{\\nu(K)\\mid K\\in\\mathcal R\\land K\\subseteq A\\land\\forall\\mathcal U\\subseteq\\tau\\;(K\\subseteq\\bigcup\\mathcal U\\to\\exists\\mathcal V\\in[\\mathcal U]^{&lt;\\omega}\\;(K\\subseteq\\bigcup\\mathcal V))\\}\\right)\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal R\\;\\left(\\nu(A)=\\inf\\{\\nu(U)\\mid U\\in\\mathcal R\\cap\\tau\\land A\\subseteq U\\}\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Regularity is now evaluated relative to a genuine topology on the declared carrier.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-topology.md","status":"resolved","id":"e7514bc4cefba4f2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-topology.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-topology.md","status":"resolved","id":"e7514bc4cefba4f2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Top}\\subseteq V^2$ (see [[../batch14/58-df-topology.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\tau,\\mathcal R,\\nu,A,B,K,U,\\mathcal U,\\mathcal V\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Top}\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure4RegularContent}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure4\\text{-}regular\\text{-}content} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure4RegularContent}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal R,\\nu)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)\\land\\mathcal R\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land\\emptyset\\in\\mathcal R\\land\\forall A,B\\in\\mathcal R\\;(A\\cup B\\in\\mathcal R\\land A\\setminus B\\in\\mathcal R)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\nu,\\mathcal R,[0,\\infty])\\land\\nu(\\emptyset)=0\\land\\forall A,B\\in\\mathcal R\\;(A\\cap B=\\emptyset\\to\\nu(A\\cup B)=\\nu(A)+\\nu(B))\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal R\\;\\left(\\nu(A)=\\sup\\{\\nu(K)\\mid K\\in\\mathcal R\\land K\\subseteq A\\land\\forall\\mathcal U\\subseteq\\tau\\;(K\\subseteq\\bigcup\\mathcal U\\to\\exists\\mathcal V\\in[\\mathcal U]^{<\\omega}\\;(K\\subseteq\\bigcup\\mathcal V))\\}\\right)\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal R\\;\\left(\\nu(A)=\\inf\\{\\nu(U)\\mid U\\in\\mathcal R\\cap\\tau\\land A\\subseteq U\\}\\right)","display":true}],"bytes":1660,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2600","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-measure4-regular-content.md|58-df-zfc-measure4-regular-content]]（batch08）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","e7514bc4cefba4f2","36d7463d215be751"]}